        "descriptionHtml": "<p>con DC 18, one creature within 5 feet that is willing or that has the Grappled, Incapacitated, or Restrained condition. {@actSaveFail} 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage plus 16 (3d10) Necrotic damage and the creature loses its highest-level available spell slot (if any). The target's Hit Points maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains Hit Points equal to that amount. A Humanoid reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage and then buried rises the following sunset as a Vampire Spawn under the vampire's control.</p>",
